--- [Access_Control_Procedure_v3.2.docx] (excerpt)
4.3 Role Changes and Transfers
When an employee changes position, department, or shift responsibilities, HR submits a "Role Change" catalog item in ServiceNow at least 5 business days before the effective date. IT compares the current Entra ID group memberships and Google Workspace shared drive permissions against the role matrix for the new position. Access not listed for the new role is removed on the effective date; temporary overlap may be granted for no more than 14 days with the receiving manager's approval, tracked as an expiring Entra group assignment. The Operations Manager reviews all transfer tickets monthly. Quarterly, IT exports group memberships and the department heads attest that each member still requires the access.
